{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>Any fat of an ox</b> etc. We have heard the warning; from where the punishment? Scripture says, ״כי כל אוכל חלב״ etc. <b>כל חלב שור</b> etc. — it restates the verse to exclude an unclean animal, a wild animal, and a bird, for the prohibition of fat does not apply to them."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:33.197437002Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}